  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "There are configuration variations in Tomcat supplied with various Linux distros.  In particular the Debian distribution does not have the same location for common jar files as a stand-alone installation of Tomcat 6.  This can lead to installation errors - see issue raised by Graeme West at  ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://comments.gmane.org/gmane.comp.cms.fedora-commons.user/5637"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://comments.gmane.org/gmane.comp.cms.fedora-commons.user/5637",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The installer should examine $CATALINA_HOME/conf/catalina.properties - the common.loader.property, and deal sensibly with this",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Options could include",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "1 warn if the intended location is not present",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2 inform user what config changes are needed for Tomcat",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "3 offer user ability to specify an alternative path, informing them of the contents of the common.loader property to guide them",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "4 automatically modify Tomcat configuration",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I would suggest 1, then 3 with the option to quit at this point so user can update the Tomcat configuration if necessary (ie 2).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
