    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:e0aa7fa8-15bc-416f-a400-bd39f84f4169",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/435786e29ee90ecc4c28d9aa6fe34fa2?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCT-1.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/435786e29ee90ecc4c28d9aa6fe34fa2?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCT-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/435786e29ee90ecc4c28d9aa6fe34fa2?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCT-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/435786e29ee90ecc4c28d9aa6fe34fa2?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCT-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Conal Tuohy",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae0aa7fa8-15bc-416f-a400-bd39f84f4169",
      "timeZone": "Australia/Brisbane"
     },
     "body": "<p>I have a similar problem installing on Centos 5.5 with Tomcat 6 installed from RPM.</p>\n\n<p>I have the following file system structure:</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;root@prov /&#93;</span># ll /usr/share/tomcat6<br/>\ntotal 4<br/>\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 root root 4096 May 30 12:49 bin<br/>\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 root root   12 May 30 12:49 conf -&gt; /etc/tomcat6<br/>\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 root root   23 May 30 12:49 lib -&gt; /usr/share/java/tomcat6<br/>\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 root root   16 May 30 12:49 logs -&gt; /var/log/tomcat6<br/>\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 root root   23 May 30 12:49 temp -&gt; /var/cache/tomcat6/temp<br/>\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 root root   24 May 30 12:49 webapps -&gt; /var/lib/tomcat6/webapps<br/>\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 root root   23 May 30 12:49 work -&gt; /var/cache/tomcat6/work</p>\n\n<p>What I wonder is, why does the JDBC driver have to be installed as a \"common\" jar? Can't it just be part of the Fedora webapp? </p>",
     "created": "30/May/11 9:57 AM",
     "id": "11972",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10747/comment/11972",
